{"type": "result", "session_id": "20261005_142928_ba0ddd", "exit_code": 0, "text": "Reviewed post_3b2f54b36fee4b15a2d1c3f10f4a6b31. Its conclusions are already incorporated in LABBOOK and the saved lipid-feedback response.\n\nPMC6607759 Figure 4F–G remains eligible as a PMP22 glycoform-fraction contrast, not absolute mature or surface abundance. Animal-level pairing with total PMP22 is unresolved—not proven absent. The explicitly matched medium/lysate measurements concern apoE and ABCA1, so they do not fill the PMP22-delivery gap.\n\nThe context-separated reciprocal subedges and open measurement requirement remain unchanged. No further collection, reanalysis, or follow-up is needed for this notification.", "tokens": {"input": 4839, "output": 397, "total": 197236, "cache_read": 192000, "cache_write": 0}, "duration_ms": 16227, "timestamp": 1791242407486}
